@startuml
' Figure 16.8  The argument that was almost right
' Reading order: top to bottom. On May 7, 2026, every automated check
' passed because each asked a narrower question than it seemed to. The
' supervisor's hold stopped it; the replay shows what the carrier
' would have done.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Model" as M <<model>>
participant "Gateway" as G <<ops>>
participant "Agent\ndesk" as D <<verified>>
participant "Carrier\nsandbox" as C <<ops>>
M -> G : rebook TKT-40219
G -[$FAIL]> G : checks pass
G -> D : above $250
D -> D : hold: wrong ticket
== replay, May 8 ==
G -[$FAIL]> C : reissue TKT-40219
C -[$FAIL]-> G : reissued
@enduml
